# Ugin, Eye of the Storms, -11: "Search your library for any number of colorless nonland cards, exile them, then shuffle. Until end of turn,
# you may cast those cards without paying their mana costs." Ugin comes down on turn 1 (a Black Lotus and four Moxen), +2 on turns 1 and 3
# takes his loyalty from 7 to 11, and on turn 5 he uses the -11. The library holds a Lightning Bolt (colored) and an Island (a land), which
# are not on offer (the refusal), and a Sol Ring, an Ornithopter and a Mind Stone (colorless nonland), of which Bot1 takes three. The
# Sol Ring and the Ornithopter are cast for free that turn; the Mind Stone is not, and on turn 7 the permission has ended (the refusal).

